              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “An Alupa ki Omega”, man Rwot Lubaŋa ma owaco, en Lubaŋa ma tye, dok ma yam onoŋo tye con, doki ma bibino, en Won Twer Ducu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
