                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ka doŋ anene, ci apoto woko piny ka tyene calo ŋat muto. Ento en oketo ciŋe lacuc i koma kun wacca ni, “Pe ilwor, an aye ŋat mukwoŋo ki me agikkine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an ŋat ma kwo-ni. Yam onoŋo ato woko, ento koŋ inen, kombeddi atye kwo, abibedo kwo matwal. Dok bene layab me To ki me Lyel tye bota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi doŋ ico gin ma itye ka nenone-ni, gin ma tye ki gin ma bitimme lacen i anyim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koŋ agonnyi tyen lok me muŋ me lakalatwe abiro ma ineno i ciŋa tuŋ lacuc, ki okar-mac abiro me jabu. Lakalatwe abiro gin aye lumalaika pa lwak muye Kricito ma gitye i kabedo abiro mapatpat, doŋ okar-mac abiro-ni gin aye lwak muye Kricito ma gitye i kabedo abiro mapatpat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.20"
            ]
